    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of Sahir Uldaam, a wandering wizard who visits desolate places of the world in search of new magic. His latest quest leads him to a remote island that is reported to have a very rare magic, as you explore the island, fight its unsavory inhabitants to uncover the secrets of the island.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Responsive Movement</strong><br>Run, Dodge, Vault and Move with a freedom of responsive motion matching technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Fire Magic Combat</strong><br>Wield devastating flame-based spells in real-time combat. Burn, blast, and bend fire to dominate enemies in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Rich Fantasy World</strong><br>Explore the beginning of an age long conflict in the new fantasy world of Misgara.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Adventure</strong><br>Follow the path of a mage and try to stop a deadly threat to the entire world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Fights &amp; Boss Encounters</strong><br>Face off against deadly foes and powerful enemies that test your reflexes, timing, and mastery of the flame.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of Sahir Uldaam, a wandering wizard who visits desolate places of the world in search of new magic. His latest quest leads him to a remote island that is reported to have a very rare magic, as you explore the island, fight its unsavory inhabitants to uncover the secrets of the island.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Responsive Movement</strong><br>Run, Dodge, Vault and Move with a freedom of responsive motion matching technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Fire Magic Combat</strong><br>Wield devastating flame-based spells in real-time combat. Burn, blast, and bend fire to dominate enemies in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Rich Fantasy World</strong><br>Explore the beginning of an age long conflict in the new fantasy world of Misgara.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Adventure</strong><br>Follow the path of a mage and try to stop a deadly threat to the entire world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Fights &amp; Boss Encounters</strong><br>Face off against deadly foes and powerful enemies that test your reflexes, timing, and mastery of the flame.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
